<div class="container">
  <div class="card shadow-sm">
    <div class="card-body p-4">
      <h1 class="mb-4">About Vehicle Explorer</h1>

      <p>
        Vehicle Explorer is a web application that allows users
        to explore vehicle manufacturers, models, and categories.
      </p>

      <h3 class="mt-4">Data Sources</h3>

      <h5 class="mt-3">1. NHTSA Vehicle API</h5>
      <p>
        The National Highway Traffic Safety Administration (NHTSA)
        provides vehicle manufacturer and model information through
        its public vPIC API.
      </p>
      <p>
        <%= link_to "Visit NHTSA vPIC API",
            "https://vpic.nhtsa.dot.gov/api/",
            target: "_blank" %>
      </p>

      <h5 class="mt-3">2. Faker Gem</h5>
      <p>
        Faker generates additional sample vehicle records to help
        populate and test the application database.
      </p>

      <h3 class="mt-4">Main Features</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Browse vehicle manufacturers.</li>
        <li>Explore vehicle models and details.</li>
        <li>Browse vehicles by category.</li>
        <li>Search by model or manufacturer.</li>
        <li>Filter vehicles by manufacturer and category.</li>
        <li>Navigate between related records.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="mt-4">Technology Used</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Ruby on Rails</li>
        <li>SQLite Database</li>
        <li>Bootstrap 5</li>
        <li>NHTSA vPIC API</li>
        <li>Faker Gem</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>